Fifteen hexagons through every edge
=================================

Read fifteen.pdf for the complete proof of the source bound
n(4,6,15)>=33. The bound is attributed to Goedgebeur and Jooken.

The new step fixes six independent outside vertices and attaches their
remaining incidences directly. The complete certificate excludes order32;
it makes no claim about existence at33 or completion of the original.

Run with ordinary Python and 64-bit-word nauty installed:

  python check.py --study STUDY --out FRESH --render

The default command rebuilds and repeats the complete root and completion
searches, then checks independent profile and positive completion controls.
The latter implementation controls also run with address and undefined
behaviour sanitizers. The full target searches are ordinary builds.

The incomplete first completion attempt is retained as history and gives
no coverage. Distinct review is a separate record.
